        "role": "﻿ left_arm.shoulder.pitch﻿ "
      },
      "expected": "{\"axis\":\"pitch\",\"chain\":\"left_arm\",\"index\":null,\"key\":\"left_arm.shoulder.pitch\",\"link\":\"shoulder\"}"
    },
    {
      "id": "wrapped-in-a-next-line-javascript-keeps",
      "note": "U+0085 is whitespace to Rust, Python and Go and is not whitespace to `trim()`. Kept, so the charset refuses it and the role is null — the same body described two ways by two editions would otherwise have one more remappable joint in one of them.",
