        "role": "left_arm.shoulder.pitch"
      },
      "expected": "null"
    },
    {
      "id": "a-kelvin-sign-lower-cases-to-k",
      "note": "U+212A KELVIN SIGN lower-cases to the ASCII letter k, so this is `neck` to `toLowerCase()` and the role parses. An edition that lower-cases ASCII only refuses it. `neck` is the one chain with a k in it, which is the only reason this is a roles case and not a curiosity.",
      "input": {
        "role": "necK.link.pitch"
